  "limits": [
    "This local installed-image proof uses synthetic Google, Microsoft and DAV resources at a fixed owned loopback server. It does not exercise an external provider, external DNS or live TLS.",
    "The restricted preload preserves logical native response URLs while routing only fixed owned native URL families to HTTP loopback. The CLI, shared runtime/providers, credential ports, PostgreSQL ledger and physical container SIGKILL are real installed code.",
    "All seven existing profiles are admitted by the old immutable image, then serially upgraded with full old row/history/sidecar and table/index OID equality. The new image delivers every old pending operation and reruns migration over their combined history. Old Graph CREATE admitted NULL/candidate and adopted NULL validator semantics remain intact.",
    "Inherited uncertain native writes cannot be replaced by a later conclusively rejected retry; earlier acceptance cannot be replaced by a later lost response. Google CREATE later matching GET therefore remains able to ACK uncertainty after an earlier unknown POST and a later404/429. Fresh known rejection followed by a newly dispatched lost response becomes uncertain.",
    "Native identity, original admitted bodies, original strong conditional validators, pending barriers and finite attempt boundaries remain unchanged. One retry is a later attempt, not a duplicate invocation within one attempt. Reference Graph remains one-shot and has no explicit resolution intent; the shared Graph explicit-resolution evidence regression is covered at its actual kernel/API boundary separately.",
    "Google UPDATE compatibility is exercised through an old pending installed operation; its inherited-evidence decision cases are covered by separate actual shared-kernel tests. This bounded proof does not claim every prior family regression was repeated inside the image.",
    "Prior installed strict DAV/Graph scope, body, candidate, timezone and readback rejection proofs remain historical evidence. This corrective proof changes neither profile guarantees nor reference storage rules.",
    "The complete source regression corpus and installed API authentication/HTTP smoke are separate evidence. No registry publication, production rollout, external consumer activation or live provider acceptance is established."
  ],
